a_as: pass statement assignment to a_ok, fail statement assignment to a_bad
m_am: pass statement assignment to m_ok, fail statement assignment to m_bad
c_cv: pass statement assignment to c_hit
r_rs: pass statement NULL, fail statement NULL
m_am callbacks: start 3, success 2, failure 1
r_rs callbacks: start 0, success 0, failure 0
assert: pass 2, fail 1; assume: pass 2, fail 1; cover: 2
